 [AICamp](https://www.aicamp.ai/event/eventdetails/W2026100715) is required for admission. RSVP on meetup is turned off.\n\nBuilding Next Gen Autonomous Agentic Systems with Google - Toronto\n\nJoin Google and AICamp for an intensive, in-person build lab where theory translates directly into functional software. Most AI tutorials stop at simple single-turn prompts, but scalable systems require autonomous agents that reason over live data, manage persistent context, and execute complex multi-step tasks. In this hands-on workshop, you will step beyond conversational interfaces to architect, configure, and deploy next-generation autonomous agentic systems using Google Cloud.\n\nBring your laptop! This is an active engineering session with zero local setup required. You will leave with a fully functioning system running in your cloud environment.\n\n**What We'll Do:**\n\n* Autonomous Task Orchestration: Configure multi-step agent workflows that plan, reason, and act across complex task flows.\n* State \u0026 Tool Integration: Connect agent architectures to cloud tools, execution environments, and live datasets.\n* Resilient System Design: Implement robust patterns built to manage complex runtime inputs, long-running processes, and error recovery.\n\n**Agenda:**\n\\- 5:00pm\\~5:30pm: Checkin\\, food and networking\n\\- 5:30pm\\~7:30pm: Hands\\-on workshop/Code labs\n\\- 7:30pm\\~8:00pm: Build your own projects\n\\- 8:00pm\\~8:30pm: Demo\\, Open discussion and Mixer\n\n**Hands-on Workshop: Building Resilient Asynchronous Agents**\nMoving beyond conversational chatbots requires systems that do more than predict the next token. Real-world autonomous architectures must plan multi-step operations, interface with external tools, maintain state across asynchronous operations, and recover cleanly from runtime failures.\nIn this intensive 90-minute, in-person masterclass, you will move directly into active engineering. Working entirely inside Google Cloud Shell, you will build and deploy a next-generation autonomous agentic system from the ground up—wiring dynamic tool calling, state management, and resilient multi-step orchestration into a cohesive, runnable architecture.\nNo slides, no abstract theory, and zero local setup required. Bring your laptop, build alongside Google engineers, and leave with a fully functional autonomous system running live in the cloud.\n\n**Sponsors:**\nWe are actively seeking sponsors to support AI developers community. Whether it is by offering venue spaces, providing food, or cash sponsorship. Sponsors will not only speak at the meetups, receive prominent recognition, but also gain exposure to our extensive membership base of 10,000+ AI developers in Toronto or 500K+ worldwide.","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/aittg-toronto/events/316770660/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536378112"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536378112"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:27759408"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":19,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:230389287"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:363135394"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:390254018"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:210920281"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:275780807"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:284579031"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:474458043"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"M