eUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-events/","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/1/6/a/highres_535868554.jpeg","id":"535868554"},"Group:38641426":{"__typename":"Group","id":"38641426","name":"Beginner Spanish Mississauga","urlname":"beginner-spanish-mississauga","timezone":"America/Toronto","keyGroupPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535868554"},"stats":{"__typename":"GroupStats","eventRatings":{"__typename":"GroupStatsEventRatings","average":5,"totalRatings":2}}},"PhotoInfo:326132508":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"326132508","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/7/e/f/c/highres_326132508.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:189305979":{"__typename":"Member","id":"189305979","name":"Vic","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:326132508"}},"Member:483510853":{"__typename":"Member","id":"483510853","name":"islandnanny73","memberPhoto":null},"Event:316602267":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316602267","dateTime":"2026-10-07T17:30:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"beginner-spanish-mississauga","__ref":"Group:38641426"},"title":"Beginner Spanish Classes (In-Person)","description":"**Spanish in Mississauga - Introduction to Spanish**\nNew beginner Spanish language classes in Mississauga\n\nIn this class, we will explore the Spanish language through 8 modules. We will cover basic concepts which you need to know in any Spanish-speaking country, and we will begin speaking right away and practicing in groups by module 3.\n\nThe goal is that you gain a basic understanding of the language. Weekly homework is required and active participation is encouraged.\n\n**These classes are not free.** Please consider watching an information session to learn more about the structure and how you can be part of this learning community.\n**Costs:** In-person registration can be made during the first class, and you can pay all classes at once without incurring payment fees (on this platform). You can also register for all classes right here on Eventbrite.\n\n**Date:** We will host weekly beginner Spanish classes weekly, for four (4) weeks:\n\n* October 7\n* October 14\n* October 21\n* October 28\n\nWe may offer a class social - practice in a group setting, restaurant or venue TBD.\nThis is your opportunity to learn language in only four classes!\n\n**Time**: Classes will begin at 5:30pm and will end at 6:30pm.\n\n**Location:** Mississauga Valley Community Centre\nClasses will be held in-person .\n\nPlease ensure that you participate in all four (4) classes, as we have already covered pronunciation and are practicing with our peers by class 2.\n\nIf you cannot attend all classes, consider joining us next month. We will continue to offer them on the first 4 Wednesdays of each month - participation in all classes is mandatory.\n\n**The instructor**\nMeet Rohit (Vic) Mehta- a fluent spanish speaker who has been a private tutor since 2014. He is continuing the popular Beginner Spanish Class series which was offered during pre-Covid times.\n\nWe hope to see you there! If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us! Email dogoodspanish@gmail.com\n\n**Frequently Asked Questions:**\n\n**Do the classes have a cost?**\nYes, classes cost 20 each + fees (if paying online). You can also contribute cash or pay by interac e-transfer. There is an additional textbook available for purchase for 20.\n\n**How long are the classes?**\nClasses are held in-person for one (1) hour per week x 4 weeks. At the end of the weekly sessions, we will invite you to a social on a separate evening or weekend.\n\n**What should I bring?**\nA water bottle, snack, notebook and pen.\n\n**Is free parking available?**\nYes, the Mississauga Valley Community Centre has ample parking, and is also very accessible by transit.\n\n**Can I bring a friend?**\nYes absolutely, however all participants need to pay as an individual. We will credit you one (1) FREE class for bringing a friend.\n\n**Can I bring my kids?**\nNo, this is an adult only class. The themes are fast-paced and we want all participants to feel comfortable. We can make exceptions for older teenagers.\n\n**What if I miss a class?**\nIt is recommended that you attend all four (4) classes in the series. We can make a rare exception and offer a paid, Zoom class, for extreme circumstances.\n\n**What if I already took a beginner class?**\nConsider joining our Intermediate Class 4-part series, from 6:40pm to 7:40pm, beginning on the first Wednesday of each month.","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/beginner-spanish-mississauga/events/316602267/","isSaved":false,"maxTickets":16,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536165746"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536165746"},"feeSettings":null,"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":2,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:189305979"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:483510853"}}}]},"series":{"__typename":"Series","description":"Every week on Wednesday until October 28, 2026","weeklyRecurrence":{"__typename":"WeeklyRecurrenceInfo","weeklyDaysOfWeek":["WEDNESDAY"],"weeklyInterval":1},"monthlyRecurrence":null,"events({\"numberOfEvents\":5,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-02\"})":{"__typename":"SeriesEventConnection","edges":[{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316602267"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316700094"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316803906"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:kzghbvyjcnblc"}}]}},"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"Mississauga Valley Community Centre, Hazel MacCallion Hall","address":"1275 Mississauga Valley Blvd., ON L5A 3R8","city":"Mississauga","state":"ON","country":"ca"}},"Event:316700094":{"__ty